  enactmentDate 1987-09-15
  ministry `Ministry of Agriculture and Farmers Welfare`
  department `Department of Animal Husbandry and Dairying`
  longTitle `An Act to declare the institution known as the National Dairy Development Board in the State of Gujarat to be an institution of national importance and to provide for its incorporation and for the vesting in that body corporate of the undertakings of the Indian Dairy Corporation with a view to provide for the administration and the carrying on of the functions to be performed by the body corporate more effectively throughout the country and for matters connected therewith and incidental thereto.`
