  slug the-swadeshi-cotton-mills-company-limited-acquisition-and-transfer-of-undertakings-act-1986
  title `The Swadeshi Cotton Mills Company Limited (Acquisition and Transfer of Undertakings) Act, 1986`
  localizedTitles obj_root_laws_the_swadeshi_cotton_mills_company_limited_acquisition_and_transfer_of_undertakings_act_2
  actNumber (30)
  actYear (1986)
  enactmentDate 1986-05-30
  ministry `Ministry of Textiles`
  department obj_root_laws_the_swadeshi_cotton_mills_company_limited_acquisition_and_transfer_of_undertakings_act_3
  longTitle `An Act to provide for the acquisition and transfer of certain textile undertakings of the Swadeshi Cotton Mills Company Limited, with a view to securing the proper management of such undertakings so as to subserve the interests of the general public by ensuring the continued manufacture, production and distribution of different varieties of cloth and yarn and thereby to give effect to the policy of the State towards securing the principles specified in clauses (b) and (c) of article 39 of the Constitution and for matters connected therewith or incidental thereto.`
  category property
  categoryTags obj_root_laws_the_swadeshi_cotton_mills_company_limited_acquisition_and_transfer_of_undertakings_act_4
